  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b1c3cae70ad8d9641a4b5be915b33736, type: 3}
  m_Name: Album2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - speakerName: Genie
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4de602275831a314da9bbbc701377c83, type: 3}
    text: Hey...
  - speakerName: Genie
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4a065c356b09ccf4ab23f3ffd7b568e5, type: 3}
    text: Don't be sad
  - speakerName: Genie
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c8ae8ad4b19d4d245815a4d418701c43, type: 3}
    text: Let me give you the wish
  - speakerName: Genie
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c8ae8ad4b19d4d245815a4d418701c43, type: 3}
    text: That picture is enough.
  - speakerName: You
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c347e233790817342891cf3a95ba10e5, type: 3}
    text: Enough for what?
  - speakerName: Genie
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4a065c356b09ccf4ab23f3ffd7b568e5, type: 3}
    text: For me. I will remember him.
  - speakerName: Genie
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4a065c356b09ccf4ab23f3ffd7b568e5, type: 3}
    text: You finished my request. So now, I can grant your wish.
  - speakerName: Genie
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c8ae8ad4b19d4d245815a4d418701c43, type: 3}
    text: But before that, please read the full magical user agreement.
  - speakerName: You
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 787fafedeaa52fc4a96a9263c592c76e, type: 3}
    text: The what?
  - speakerName: Genie
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c8ae8ad4b19d4d245815a4d418701c43, type: 3}
    text: By making a wish, you agree that the Cow Genie, the lamp, the lake, the
      chicken family, and any nearby dead relatives are not responsible for any side
      effects caused by your wish.
  - speakerName: You
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 36d07941ce46d5347839b5f70bf36094, type: 3}
    text: Oh no.
  - speakerName: Genie
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c8ae8ad4b19d4d245815a4d418701c43, type: 3}
    text: 'Side effects may include, but are not limited to: emotional damage, physical
      damage, spiritual damage, bad luck, weird dreams, awkward family reunions,
      sudden pizza cravings, and being turned into a lesson for children.'
  - speakerName: Genie
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4a065c356b09ccf4ab23f3ffd7b568e5, type: 3}
    text: You also agree that your wish must be clear, simple, affordable, and not
      annoying. If your wish is too big, too powerful, too vague, or sounds like
      something a villain would ask for, I have the right to say no.
  - speakerName: Genie
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c8ae8ad4b19d4d245815a4d418701c43, type: 3}
    text: The Cow Genie is also not responsible if your wish technically comes true
      but in a stupid way. If you wish to be rich, I might give you one very confident
      coin. If you wish for love, I might give you a chicken who likes your shoes.
      If you wish for food, please understand that pizza is the safest option.
  - speakerName: Genie
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4a065c356b09ccf4ab23f3ffd7b568e5, type: 3}
    text: Finally, once your wish is made, it cannot be refunded, exchanged, reviewed,
      appealed, complained about, or blamed on me. By continuing, you agree that
      you are making this wish with your own free will, your own bad judgment, and
      probably not enough information.
  options:
  - speakerName: You
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 787fafedeaa52fc4a96a9263c592c76e, type: 3}
    replyText: I Agree
    nextNode: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 54633153bf68ef94c8aa320e2d65df85, type: 2}
  - speakerName: You
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 787fafedeaa52fc4a96a9263c592c76e, type: 3}
    replyText: I do not agree to any of this.
    nextNode: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e67edafa431477a4f91a43cb3c2b475e, type: 2}
